-3.  **Warping Function Application**: Calculate the warping scalar $W(\mathbf{p})$ using the radial distortion formula:
-    $$ W(\mathbf{p}) = \frac{1}{\sqrt{|\mathbf{p}| \cdot d_{max}}} $$
